    {
      "id": "finite-difference-derivatives-r1-q3",
      "round": 1,
      "type": "mc",
      "prompt": "The leading truncation error of the central difference is",
      "explanation": "Adding the expansions of \\(f(x+h)\\) and subtracting \\(f(x-h)\\) cancels the even powers. The first surviving error is the third-derivative term, and dividing by \\(2h\\) leaves a factor \\(h^2\\). The second-derivative term is the one the central difference cancels; it is the leading error of the forward difference. Round-off is a separate contribution that grows as the step shrinks. The error is zero for polynomials of degree at most \\(2\\), not for every smooth function.",
      "figure": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 176\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\"><title>a sampled curve</title><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"146\" x2=\"318\" y2=\"146\"/><polygon points=\"318,146 311.6,148.7 311.6,143.3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><line x1=\"46\" y1=\"146\" x2=\"46\" y2=\"24\"/><polygon points=\"46,24 48.7,30.4 43.3,30.4\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/><text x=\"318\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">t</text><text x=\"50\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\">f</text><polyline points=\"46,132.9 49,132.9 52,132.9 55.1,132.9 58.1,132.9 61.1,132.8 64.1,132.8 67.2,132.8 70.2,132.8 73.2,132.8 76.2,132.7 79.2,132.7 82.3,132.6 85.3,132.6 88.3,132.5 91.3,132.4 94.4,132.3 97.4,132.2 100.4,132.1 103.4,132 106.4,131.8 109.5,131.7 112.5,131.5 115.5,131.3 118.5,131.1 121.6,130.9 124.6,130.6 127.6,130.3 130.6,130 133.6,129.7 136.7,129.4 139.7,129 142.7,128.6 145.7,128.2 148.8,127.8 151.8,127.3 154.8,126.9 157.8,126.3 160.8,125.8 163.9,125.2 166.9,124.6 169.9,124 172.9,123.3 176,122.6 179,121.9 182,121.1 185,120.3 188,119.5 191.1,118.6 194.1,117.7 197.1,116.8 200.1,115.8 203.2,114.8 206.2,113.7 209.2,112.6 212.2,111.4 215.2,110.3 218.3,109 221.3,107.7 224.3,106.4 227.3,105.1 230.4,103.6 233.4,102.2 236.4,100.7 239.4,99.1 242.4,97.5 245.5,95.9 248.5,94.1 251.5,92.4 254.5,90.6 257.6,88.7 260.6,86.8 263.6,84.8 266.6,82.8 269.6,80.7 272.7,78.6 275.7,76.4 278.7,74.1 281.7,71.8 284.8,69.4 287.8,67 290.8,64.4 293.8,61.9 296.8,59.3 299.9,56.6 302.9,53.8 305.9,51 308.9,48.1 312,45.1 315,42.1 318,39\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/></svg>",
